# Production defaults, read by `vite build`. An exported shell variable of the same name wins, so a
# fork or a one-off build overrides any of these without editing this file.

# The art host: where art uploaded through the launch wizard is stored and served, under the IPFS
# CIDs it was built with. Hosting is temporary and makes no permanence claim; the art is expected
# to move to IPFS after its collection graduates. This line is the ONLY place the default host is
# written. Set VITE_ART_HOST= (empty) at build time to ship without the upload option — the wizard
# then offers the paste-a-link field alone.
VITE_ART_HOST=https://art.miladystation2.net
